{"unit_id":"huajiang114514__dsh-music-companion#card-zh","repo":"huajiang114514/dsh-music-companion","commit":"24a537f780d14a08c9b779e3c2c1626192ed5897","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-music-companion 是面向 Windows 桌面 DSH 的音乐陪伴插件。它轮询 Windows 系统媒体会话，读取歌曲标题、歌手、专辑和播放信息；当检测到歌曲切换并稳定播放后，会把预设话头发送到指定 DSH 会话。插件可按歌曲数或每周触发口味总结，并维护本地听歌流水、日记和运行日志。它适合希望让 DSH 随播放歌曲回应、同时积累音乐记录的用户。使用时需配置目标会话，并使用支持 Windows 系统媒体控制的播放器；无需插件专用 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-189","lib/nowplaying.ps1:33-55"]}
{"unit_id":"huajiang114514__dsh-music-companion#card-en","repo":"huajiang114514/dsh-music-companion","commit":"24a537f780d14a08c9b779e3c2c1626192ed5897","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-music-companion is a Windows DSH plugin that polls system media sessions for track metadata. After a stable track change, it sends a prompt to a configured DSH session and stores local listening history and diary notes. It needs a target session and a compatible player.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:154-189","lib/nowplaying.ps1:33-55"]}
